    {"type": "cause", "text": "FY2026's step was cloud-led: cloud and software revenue rose $9.3 billion as customers bought applications and infrastructure and renewed cloud contracts [P17][P20]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "drivers", "title": "What drove growth", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Cloud Infrastructure is now the growth engine, contributing 13.7pp of the 17.3% revenue growth in FY2026 on 76.9% growth [D645][D421][D644]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "It reached 26.9% of revenue, while Software Support slipped to 29.4% and Software License fell 8.9% [D643][D613][D681]."},
