    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating income grew 16.6% against 17.3% revenue growth, so incremental margin was 29.4% and operating expenses grew 17.7% [D422][D421][D442][D436]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Diluted EPS grew 34.3% against 36.5% net income growth as the diluted share count rose 1.7% [D425][D423][D438]."}
