    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Free cash flow was negative $23.7 billion, a -35.2% margin, as capex reached $55.7 billion, 82.6% of revenue [F104][D405][F94][D404]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Capex rose $34.4 billion, taking capex to 7.30x D&A, as the company built data center capacity [P5][D410]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Free cash flow was -1.39x net income against a 1.06x window median, and operating cash flow covered net income 1.88x [D409][D800][D408]."}
